        "eyebrow": "From the house",
        "heading": "A Note From the House",
        "note": "<p>This one is for the Betty who has had the most practice. She is not the loudest in the room and never has been — she simply arrives, remembers your sister's name, and leaves the place warmer than she found it.</p><p>We made a perfume that behaves the way she does. It does not announce itself at the door. It stays near the skin, keeps its own counsel, and turns up in your memory a week later, uninvited.</p>",
